<title>USA: Tosco Corp Q3 net rises to $0.95/shr.</title>
<headline>Tosco Corp Q3 net rises to $0.95/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.95		    $0.72</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.95		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net			 42,493		   26,844</p>
<p> Sales		  2,709,388		1,816,846</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	44,609		   37,478</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	44,725		   37,579</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call consensus analysts' estimate 1996 Q3 $0.93/shr.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.86		    $1.16</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.84		    $1.15</p>
<p> Net			116,097		   43,295</p>
<p> Revs		   7,160,151		5,417,203</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	40,658		   37,429</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	40,840		   37,572</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '96 9 Mths include $8.1 million or $0.20/shr after tax charge related to Circle K acquisition. '95 9 mths include after-tax restructure charge of $3.1 million or $0.08/shr.</p>
</text>
